  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.68,
   "text": "Second good check checked. The same way that's .2 spent, the limit reached."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.78,
   "end": 13.58,
   "text": "One more call and the contract says no before any money moves. Over budget refused on the"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.58,
   "end": 20.14,
   "text": "record. Balance untouched. One honest limit. This protects the buyer, not the seller."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.86,
   "end": 26.56,
   "text": "A dishonest buyer could still claim a failure. The buyer checks every receipt. The contract"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.56,
   "end": 33.84,
   "text": "only pays on one the buyer has signed. Meted pay. Failed call. Deducted zero."
  }
 ],
